    "group": "Burna‑bommer",
    "summary": "As the opponent's [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) ends, pick one **visible** enemy unit no more than 36\" away from this unit, other than **[Lone Operative](vsdata:core-ability/lone-operative)** and **MONSTER/VEHICLE** units, and roll one D6. On a 2+:\n\n- That unit takes D3 **[mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)**.\n- Until your next turn ends, it cannot be **hidden**.\n- Until your next turn ends, ranged attacks against it have **[[IGNORES COVER]](vsdata:weapon-ability/ignores-cover)**.",
